ts those control metrics side by side with your value metrics,","tokens":[50864,440,6175,22259,8137,729,1969,16367,1252,538,1252,365,428,2158,16367,11,51164],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2179846465587616,"compression_ratio":1.4883720874786377,"no_speech_prob":0.004468084778636694},{"id":21,"seek":11900,"start":135.0,"end":140.0,"text":" cycle time, analyst hours deployed, and your detection time.","tokens":[51164,6586,565,11,19085,2496,17826,11,293,428,17784,565,13,51414],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2179846465587616,"compression_ratio":1.4883720874786377,"no_speech_prob":0.004468084778636694},{"id":22,"seek":14000,"start":141.0,"end":148.0,"text":" And with that single-page view, the steering committee can make clean, efficient data-backed decisions","tokens":[50414,400,365,300,2167,12,15161,1910,11,264,14823,7482,393,652,2541,11,7148,1412,12,3207,292,5327,50764],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.1885146051645279,"compression_ratio":1.5153061151504517,"no_speech_prob":0.19924607872962952},{"id":23,"seek":14000,"start":148.0,"end":159.0,"text":" to either promote the agent, hold it where it is, step it back, or down to supervised review stage.","tokens":[50764,281,2139,9773,264,9461,11,1797,309,689,309,307,11,1823,309,646,11,420,760,281,46533,3131,3233,13,51314],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.1885146051645279,"compression_ratio":1.5153061151504517,"no_speech_prob":0.19924607872962952},{"id":24,"seek":14000,"start":159.0,"end":164.0,"text":" So let's come back to the three questions.","tokens":[51314,407,718,311,808,646,281,264,1045,1651,13,51564],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.1885146051645279,"compression_ratio":1.5153061151504517,"no_speech_prob":0.19924607872962952},{"id":25,"seek":14000,"start":164.0,"end":169.0,"text":" Ask them of every agent you build, fund, or govern.","tokens":[51564,12320,552,295,633,9461,291,1322,11,2374,11,420,1980,13,51814],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.1885146051645279,"compression_ratio":1.5153061151504517,"no_speech_prob":0.19924607872962952},{"id":26,"seek":16900,"start":169.0,"end":172.0,"text":" What value does it create?","tokens":[50364,708,2158,775,309,1884,30,50514],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.15775923430919647,"compression_ratio":1.5021644830703735,"no_speech_prob":0.002757467096671462},{"id":27,"seek":16900,"start":172.0,"end":175.0,"text":" Who is accountable for it?","tokens":[50514,2102,307,18024,337,309,30,50664],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.15775923430919647,"compression_ratio":1.5021644830703735,"no_speech_prob":0.002757467096671462},{"id":28,"seek":16900,"start":175.0,"end":180.0,"text":" And what evidence permits it to operate with autonomy?","tokens":[50664,400,437,4467,30990,309,281,9651,365,27278,30,50914],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.15775923430919647,"compression_ratio":1.5021644830703735,"no_speech_prob":0.002757467096671462},{"id":29,"seek":16900,"start":180.0,"end":186.0,"text":" In our M&A example today, the agent does not magically create the $400 million in synergies.","tokens":[50914,682,527,376,5,32,1365,965,11,264,9461,775,406,39763,1884,264,1848,13741,2459,294,33781,25480,13,51214],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.15775923430919647,"compression_ratio":1.5021644830703735,"no_speech_prob":0.002757467096671462},{"id":30,"seek":16900,"start":186.0,"end":194.0,"text":" Procurement, supply chain, and operating leaders capture that value through the gritty work of integration.","tokens":[51214,1705,66,540,518,11,5847,5021,11,293,7447,3523,7983,300,2158,807,264,677,10016,589,295,10980,13,51614],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.15775923430919647,"compression_ratio":1.5021644830703735,"no_speech_prob":0.002757467096671462},{"id":31,"seek":16900,"start":194.0,"end":197.0,"text":" But what the agent delivers is clear.","tokens":[51614,583,437,264,9461,24860,307,1850,13,51764],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.15775923430919647,"compression_ratio":1.5021644830703735,"no_speech_prob":0.002757467096671462},{"id":32,"seek":19700,"start":197.0,"end":204.0,"text":" Verified evidence weeks ahead of schedule, giving leadership the runway to intervene","tokens":[50364,4281,2587,4467,3259,2286,295,7567,11,2902,5848,264,26642,281,30407,50714],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.16812944412231445,"compression_ratio":1.4810811281204224,"no_speech_prob":0.02797333151102066},{"id":33,"seek":19700,"start":204.0,"end":209.0,"text":" while the deal's synergies can still be captured.","tokens":[50714,1339,264,2028,311,33781,25480,393,920,312,11828,13,50964],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.16812944412231445,"compression_ratio":1.4810811281204224,"no_speech_prob":0.02797333151102066},{"id":34,"seek":19700,"start":209.0,"end":213.0,"text":" Building an agent that works is just the first step.","tokens":[50964,18974,364,9461,300,1985,307,445,264,700,1823,13,51164],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.16812944412231445,"compression_ratio":1.4810811281204224,"no_speech_prob":0.02797333151102066},{"id":35,"seek":19700,"start":213.0,"end":220.0,"text":" Answering those three questions is what earns it the trust to run at scale.","tokens":[51164,24545,278,729,1045,1651,307,437,46936,309,264,3361,281,1190,412,4373,13,51514],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.16812944412231445,"compression_ratio":1.4810811281204224,"no_speech_prob":0.02797333151102066},{"id":36,"seek":19700,"start":220.0,"end":222.0,"text":" Thank you.","tokens":[51514,1044,291,13,51614],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.16812944412231445,"compression_ratio":1.4810811281204224,"no_speech_prob":0.02797333151102066},{"id":37,"seek":22200,"start":222.0,"end":245.0,"text":" ♪","tokens":[50364,672,247,103,51514],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.30964264273643494,"compression_ratio":0.9047619104385376,"no_speech_prob":0.17531327903270721},{"id":38,"seek":22200,"start":245.0,"end":249.0,"text":" Hi, I'm Steve Jamieson, AI Research and Engineering Leader at Jellyfish.","tokens":[51514,2421,11,286,478,7466,10372,530,266,11,7318,10303,293,16215,22650,412,38815,11608,13,51714],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.30964264273643494,"compression_ratio":0.9047619104385376,"no_speech_prob":0.17531327903270721},{"id":39,"seek":24900,"start":249.0,"end":253.0,"text":" I'm here to show you why tokens are the cheap part.","tokens":[50364,286,478,510,281,855,291,983,22667,366,264,7084,644,13,50564],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.14283087849617004,"compression_ratio":1.6135457754135132,"no_speech_prob":0.16228093206882477},{"id":40,"seek":24900,"start":253.0,"end":256.0,"text":" The research that I'll present is drawn from the Jellyfish platform,","tokens":[50564,440,2132,300,286,603,1974,307,10117,490,264,38815,11608,3663,11,50714],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.14283087849617004,"compression_ratio":1.6135457754135132,"no_speech_prob":0.16228093206882477},{"id":41,"seek":24900,"start":256.0,"end":263.0,"text":" the industry's largest set of engineering workflow data joined to AI telemetry data.","tokens":[50714,264,3518,311,6443,992,295,7043,20993,1412,6869,281,7318,4304,5537,627,1412,13,51064],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.14283087849617004,"compression_ratio":1.6135457754135132,"no_speech_prob":0.16228093206882477},{"id":42,"seek":24900,"start":263.0,"end":266.0,"text":" It's no secret that AI costs are climbing.","tokens":[51064,467,311,572,4054,300,7318,5497,366,14780,13,51214],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.14283087849617004,"compression_ratio":1.6135457754135132,"no_speech_prob":0.16228093206882477},{"id":43,"seek":24900,"start":266.0,"end":269.0,"text":" They're up 60x from this time last year.","tokens":[51214,814,434,493,4060,87,490,341,565,1036,1064,13,51364],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.14283087849617004,"compression_ratio":1.6135457754135132,"no_speech_prob":0.16228093206882477},{"id":44,"seek":24900,"start":269.0,"end":271.0,"text":" The use cases are wide and varied.","tokens":[51364,440,764,3331,366,4874,293,22877,13,51464],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.14283087849617004,"compression_ratio":1.6135457754135132,"no_speech_prob":0.16228093206882477},{"id":45,"seek":24900,"start":271.0,"end":274.0,"text":" The models and harnesses are getting much better.","tokens":[51464,440,5245,293,19700,279,366,1242,709,1101,13,51614],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.14283087849617004,"compression_ratio":1.6135457754135132,"no_speech_prob":0.16228093206882477},{"id":46,"seek":24900,"start":274.0,"end":276.0,"text":" The implications are exciting.","tokens":[51614,440,16602,366,4670,13,51714],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.14283087849617004,"compression_ratio":1.6135457754135132,"no_speech_prob":0.16228093206882477},{"id":47,"seek":27600,"start":276.0,"end":280.0,"text":" But discussions around budget and spend are not as much fun.","tokens":[50364,583,11088,926,4706,293,3496,366,406,382,709,1019,13,50564],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.16247723996639252,"compression_ratio":1.48739492893219,"no_speech_prob":0.4108603298664093},{"id":48,"seek":27600,"start":280.0,"end":284.0,"text":" These conversations involve your peers and senior leadership and the board,","tokens":[50564,1981,7315,9494,428,16739,293,7965,5848,293,264,3150,11,50764],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.16247723996639252,"compression_ratio":1.48739492893219,"no_speech_prob":0.4108603298664093},{"id":49,"seek":27600,"start":284.0,"end":289.0,"text":" not always the easiest audiences, especially when you don't have the right data.","tokens":[50764,406,1009,264,12889,15479,11,2318,562,291,500,380,362,264,558,1412,13,51014],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.16247723996639252,"compression_ratio":1.48739492893219,"no_speech_prob":0.4108603298664093},{"id":50,"seek":27600,"start":289.0,"end":293.0,"text":" And it's real money these days.","tokens":[51014,400,309,311,957,1460,613,1708,13,51214],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.16247723996639252,"compression_ratio":1.48739492893219,"no_speech_prob":0.4108603298664093},{"id":51,"seek":27600,"start":293.0,"end":295.0,"text":" Output is up too.","tokens":[51214,5925,2582,307,493,886,13,51314],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.16247723996639252,"compression_ratio":1.48739492893219,"no_speech_prob":0.4108603298664093},{"id":52,"seek":27600,"start":295.0,"end":300.0,"text":" Merged PRs per engineer are up 43% over the same one-year horizon.","tokens":[51314,6124,3004,11568,82,680,11403,366,493,17914,4,670,264,912,472,12,5294,18046,13,51564],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.16247723996639252,"compression_ratio":1.48739492893219,"no_speech_prob":0.4108603298664093},{"id":53,"seek":27600,"start":300.0,"end":301.0,"text":" This is phenomenal.","tokens":[51564,639,307,17778,13,51614],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.16247723996639252,"compression_ratio":1.48739492893219,"no_speech_prob":0.4108603298664093},{"id":54,"seek":30100,"start":301.0,"end":308.0,"text":" We've not seen productivity inputs like this, especially on this timescale.","tokens":[50364,492,600,406,1612,15604,15743,411,341,11,2318,322,341,1413,37088,13,50714],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.18097694218158722,"compression_ratio":1.5871212482452393,"no_speech_prob":0.2199142873287201},{"id":55,"seek":30100,"start":308.0,"end":312.0,"text":" There's plenty of research and anecdotal data to know that AI","tokens":[50714,821,311,7140,295,2132,293,26652,38180,1412,281,458,300,7318,50914],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.18097694218158722,"compression_ratio":1.5871212482452393,"no_speech_prob":0.2199142873287201},{"id":56,"seek":30100,"start":312.0,"end":315.0,"text":" and agentic coding are driving these throughput gains.","tokens":[50914,293,9461,299,17720,366,4840,613,44629,16823,13,51064],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.18097694218158722,"compression_ratio":1.5871212482452393,"no_speech_prob":0.2199142873287201},{"id":57,"seek":30100,"start":315.0,"end":317.0,"text":" Heck, even our charts show the correlation.","tokens":[51064,41948,11,754,527,17767,855,264,20009,13,51164],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.18097694218158722,"compression_ratio":1.5871212482452393,"no_speech_prob":0.2199142873287201},{"id":58,"seek":30100,"start":317.0,"end":320.0,"text":" Notice where the inflection points are?","tokens":[51164,13428,689,264,1536,5450,2793,366,30,51314],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.18097694218158722,"compression_ratio":1.5871212482452393,"no_speech_prob":0.2199142873287201},{"id":59,"seek":30100,"start":320.0,"end":323.0,"text":" AI spend increased in early 2026,","tokens":[51314,7318,3496,6505,294,2440,945,10880,11,51464],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.18097694218158722,"compression_ratio":1.5871212482452393,"no_speech_prob":0.2199142873287201},{"id":60,"seek":30100,"start":323.0,"end":327.0,"text":" and throughput gains start a steady increase of their own.","tokens":[51464,293,44629,16823,722,257,13211,3488,295,641,1065,13,51664],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.18097694218158722,"compression_ratio":1.5871212482452393,"no_speech_prob":0.2199142873287201},{"id":61,"seek":30100,"start":327.0,"end":330.0,"text":" There's a tension with these two numbers, though.","tokens":[51664,821,311,257,8980,365,613,732,3547,11,1673,13,51814],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.18097694218158722,"compression_ratio":1.5871212482452393,"no_speech_prob":0.2199142873287201},{"id":62,"seek":33000,"start":330.0,"end":332.0,"text":" How do you reconcile them?","tokens":[50364,1012,360,291,41059,552,30,50464],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.14670298993587494,"compression_ratio":1.3926701545715332,"no_speech_prob":0.08508878946304321},{"id":63,"seek":33000,"start":332.0,"end":334.0,"text":" Spend is up 60x.","tokens":[50464,1738,521,307,493,4060,87,13,50564],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.14670298993587494,"compression_ratio":1.3926701545715332,"no_speech_prob":0.08508878946304321},{"id":64,"seek":33000,"start":334.0,"end":337.0,"text":" Throughput is also up 43%.","tokens":[50564,8927,2582,307,611,493,17914,6856,50714],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.14670298993587494,"compression_ratio":1.3926701545715332,"no_speech_prob":0.08508878946304321},{"id":65,"seek":33000,"start":337.0,"end":339.0,"text":" Is that good? Bad?","tokens":[50714,1119,300,665,30,11523,30,50814],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.14670298993587494,"compression_ratio":1.3926701545715332,"no_speech_prob":0.08508878946304321},{"id":66,"seek":33000,"start":339.0,"end":344.0,"text":" 43% is a big number, but so is 60x.","tokens":[50814,17914,4,307,257,955,1230,11,457,370,307,4060,87,13,51064],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.14670298993587494,"compression_ratio":1.3926701545715332,"no_speech_prob":0.08508878946304321},{"id":67,"seek":33000,"start":344.0,"end":347.0,"text":" How do you know if you're spending enough?","tokens":[51064,1012,360,291,458,498,291,434,6434,1547,30,51214],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.14670298993587494,"compression_ratio":1.3926701545715332,"no_speech_prob":0.08508878946304321},{"id":68,"seek":33000,"start":347.0,"end":352.0,"text":" Is there more productivity gain locked behind a checkbook?","tokens":[51214,1119,456,544,15604,6052,9376,2261,257,1520,2939,30,51464],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.14670298993587494,"compression_ratio":1.3926701545715332,"no_speech_prob":0.08508878946304321},{"id":69,"seek":33000,"start":352.0,"end":357.0,"text":" Should we increase spend 50%, 2x more?","tokens":[51464,6454,321,3488,3496,2625,8923,568,87,544,30,51714],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.14670298993587494,"compression_ratio":1.3926701545715332,"no_speech_prob":0.08508878946304321},{"id":70,"seek":35700,"start":357.0,"end":360.0,"text":" Or how do you know if you spent too much?","tokens":[50364,1610,577,360,291,458,498,291,4418,886,709,30,50514],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.1610991358757019,"compression_ratio":1.5852713584899902,"no_speech_prob":0.206831693649292},{"id":71,"seek":35700,"start":360.0,"end":362.0,"text":" I'm sure many of you have felt the tension here.","tokens":[50514,286,478,988,867,295,291,362,2762,264,8980,510,13,50614],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.1610991358757019,"compression_ratio":1.5852713584899902,"no_speech_prob":0.206831693649292},{"id":72,"seek":35700,"start":362.0,"end":366.0,"text":" The CFO or board are asking for the receipts of the spend.","tokens":[50614,440,383,18067,420,3150,366,3365,337,264,2268,48908,295,264,3496,13,50814],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.1610991358757019,"compression_ratio":1.5852713584899902,"no_speech_prob":0.206831693649292},{"id":73,"seek":35700,"start":366.0,"end":368.0,"text":" Can you show them?","tokens":[50814,1664,291,855,552,30,50914],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.1610991358757019,"compression_ratio":1.5852713584899902,"no_speech_prob":0.206831693649292},{"id":74,"seek":35700,"start":368.0,"end":372.0,"text":" Will merged PRs that are up 43% satisfy them?","tokens":[50914,3099,36427,11568,82,300,366,493,17914,4,19319,552,30,51114],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.1610991358757019,"compression_ratio":1.5852713584899902,"no_speech_prob":0.206831693649292},{"id":75,"seek":35700,"start":372.0,"end":377.0,"text":" Also, what happens if you cap use and spend?","tokens":[51114,2743,11,437,2314,498,291,1410,764,293,3496,30,51364],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.1610991358757019,"compression_ratio":1.5852713584899902,"no_speech_prob":0.206831693649292},{"id":76,"seek":35700,"start":377.0,"end":380.0,"text":" Are you stopping from setting tokens on fire?","tokens":[51364,2014,291,12767,490,3287,22667,322,2610,30,51514],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.1610991358757019,"compression_ratio":1.5852713584899902,"no_speech_prob":0.206831693649292},{"id":77,"seek":35700,"start":380.0,"end":383.0,"text":" Or are you stunting further efficiency gains?","tokens":[51514,1610,366,291,11885,783,3052,10493,16823,30,51664],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.1610991358757019,"compression_ratio":1.5852713584899902,"no_speech_prob":0.206831693649292},{"id":78,"seek":35700,"start":383.0,"end":386.0,"text":" You can ask peers at other companies what they're paying.","tokens":[51664,509,393,1029,16739,412,661,3431,437,436,434,6229,13,51814],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.1610991358757019,"compression_ratio":1.5852713584899902,"no_speech_prob":0.206831693649292},{"id":79,"seek":38600,"start":386.0,"end":389.0,"text":" For many, it's still a moving target, though.","tokens":[50364,1171,867,11,309,311,920,257,2684,3779,11,1673,13,50514],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.18226028978824615,"compression_ratio":1.4867256879806519,"no_speech_prob":0.08386649191379547},{"id":80,"seek":38600,"start":389.0,"end":392.0,"text":" But how do you equate that to your org?","tokens":[50514,583,577,360,291,1267,473,300,281,428,14045,30,50664],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.18226028978824615,"compression_ratio":1.4867256879806519,"no_speech_prob":0.08386649191379547},{"id":81,"seek":38600,"start":392.0,"end":396.0,"text":" Surely, just comparing their bill to yours isn't adequate.","tokens":[50664,29803,11,445,15763,641,2961,281,6342,1943,380,20927,13,50864],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.18226028978824615,"compression_ratio":1.4867256879806519,"no_speech_prob":0.08386649191379547},{"id":82,"seek":38600,"start":396.0,"end":402.0,"text":" We've heard the reports of companies spending 100k, 500k,","tokens":[50864,492,600,2198,264,7122,295,3431,6434,2319,74,11,5923,74,11,51164],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.18226028978824615,"compression_ratio":1.4867256879806519,"no_speech_prob":0.08386649191379547},{"id":83,"seek":38600,"start":402.0,"end":405.0,"text":" even millions on AI.","tokens":[51164,754,6803,322,7318,13,51314],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.18226028978824615,"compression_ratio":1.4867256879806519,"no_speech_prob":0.08386649191379547},{"id":84,"seek":38600,"start":405.0,"end":410.0,"text":" Setting, then resetting their AI budgets as reality sets in.","tokens":[51314,21063,11,550,14322,783,641,7318,26708,382,4103,6352,294,13,51564],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.18226028978824615,"compression_ratio":1.4867256879806519,"no_speech_prob":0.08386649191379547},{"id":85,"seek":38600,"start":410.0,"end":413.0,"text":" Ultimately, these two numbers can't tell the story.","tokens":[51564,23921,11,613,732,3547,393,380,980,264,1657,13,51714],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.18226028978824615,"compression_ratio":1.4867256879806519,"no_speech_prob":0.08386649191379547},{"id":86,"seek":41300,"start":413.0,"end":417.0,"text":" And even together, they missed the biggest line on the cost side.","tokens":[50364,400,754,1214,11,436,6721,264,3880,1622,322,264,2063,1252,13,50564],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.19895794987678528,"compression_ratio":1.634042501449585,"no_speech_prob":0.2940237522125244},{"id":87,"seek":41300,"start":419.0,"end":424.0,"text":" These two numbers leave out the biggest cost of all, developer salary.","tokens":[50664,1981,732,3547,1856,484,264,3880,2063,295,439,11,10754,15360,13,50914],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.19895794987678528,"compression_ratio":1.634042501449585,"no_speech_prob":0.2940237522125244},{"id":88,"seek":41300,"start":424.0,"end":429.0,"text":" AI is making developers more productive on a scale we haven't seen before.","tokens":[50914,7318,307,1455,8849,544,13304,322,257,4373,321,2378,380,1612,949,13,51164],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.19895794987678528,"compression_ratio":1.634042501449585,"no_speech_prob":0.2940237522125244},{"id":89,"seek":41300,"start":429.0,"end":432.0,"text":" It isn't just another tool, it's intelligence.","tokens":[51164,467,1943,380,445,1071,2290,11,309,311,7599,13,51314],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.19895794987678528,"compression_ratio":1.634042501449585,"no_speech_prob":0.2940237522125244},{"id":90,"seek":41300,"start":432.0,"end":437.0,"text":" This intelligence dramatically changes how much each dev can produce.","tokens":[51314,639,7599,17548,2962,577,709,1184,1905,393,5258,13,51564],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.19895794987678528,"compression_ratio":1.634042501449585,"no_speech_prob":0.2940237522125244},{"id":91,"seek":41300,"start":437.0,"end":440.0,"text":" That's why we need to think about its cost differently.","tokens":[51564,663,311,983,321,643,281,519,466,1080,2063,7614,13,51714],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.19895794987678528,"compression_ratio":1.634042501449585,"no_speech_prob":0.2940237522125244},{"id":92,"seek":44000,"start":440.0,"end":446.0,"text":" Not off to the side as overhead, but as part of what it takes to produce each PR.","tokens":[50364,1726,766,281,264,1252,382,19922,11,457,382,644,295,437,309,2516,281,5258,1184,11568,13,50664],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2069254070520401,"compression_ratio":1.4974619150161743,"no_speech_prob":0.08751148730516434},{"id":93,"seek":44000,"start":446.0,"end":450.0,"text":" We're going to call this intelligence costs of a PR.","tokens":[50664,492,434,516,281,818,341,7599,5497,295,257,11568,13,50864],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2069254070520401,"compression_ratio":1.4974619150161743,"no_speech_prob":0.08751148730516434},{"id":94,"seek":44000,"start":454.0,"end":458.0,"text":" What you pay your engineers, plus what you pay for AI,","tokens":[51064,708,291,1689,428,11955,11,1804,437,291,1689,337,7318,11,51264],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2069254070520401,"compression_ratio":1.4974619150161743,"no_speech_prob":0.08751148730516434},{"id":95,"seek":44000,"start":458.0,"end":461.0,"text":" put them together in one cost bucket.","tokens":[51264,829,552,1214,294,472,2063,13058,13,51414],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2069254070520401,"compression_ratio":1.4974619150161743,"no_speech_prob":0.08751148730516434},{"id":96,"seek":44000,"start":461.0,"end":468.0,"text":" AI is about 2.5% of the cost to produce another unit of merge code.","tokens":[51414,7318,307,466,568,13,20,4,295,264,2063,281,5258,1071,4985,295,22183,3089,13,51764],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2069254070520401,"compression_ratio":1.4974619150161743,"no_speech_prob":0.08751148730516434},{"id":97,"seek":46800,"start":468.0,"end":472.0,"text":" Salary is the other 97.5%.","tokens":[50364,5996,822,307,264,661,23399,13,20,6856,50564],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.1808965653181076,"compression_ratio":1.3664921522140503,"no_speech_prob":0.005728349555283785},{"id":98,"seek":46800,"start":472.0,"end":475.0,"text":" This is in line with other reported figures.","tokens":[50564,639,307,294,1622,365,661,7055,9624,13,50714],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.1808965653181076,"compression_ratio":1.3664921522140503,"no_speech_prob":0.005728349555283785},{"id":99,"seek":46800,"start":475.0,"end":479.0,"text":" And this data is from August 2026.","tokens":[50714,400,341,1412,307,490,6897,945,10880,13,50914],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.1808965653181076,"compression_ratio":1.3664921522140503,"no_speech_prob":0.005728349555283785},{"id":100,"seek":46800,"start":479.0,"end":483.0,"text":" Here, tokens are the cheap part.","tokens":[50914,1692,11,22667,366,264,7084,644,13,51114],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.1808965653181076,"compression_ratio":1.3664921522140503,"no_speech_prob":0.005728349555283785},{"id":101,"seek":46800,"start":483.0,"end":487.0,"text":" But that's current relative costs, not dollars.","tokens":[51114,583,300,311,2190,4972,5497,11,406,3808,13,51314],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.1808965653181076,"compression_ratio":1.3664921522140503,"no_speech_prob":0.005728349555283785},{"id":102,"seek":46800,"start":487.0,"end":491.0,"text":" Let's look at what happened to the cost of a merge PR over the last year.","tokens":[51314,961,311,574,412,437,2011,281,264,2063,295,257,22183,11568,670,264,1036,1064,13,51514],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.1808965653181076,"compression_ratio":1.3664921522140503,"no_speech_prob":0.005728349555283785},{"id":103,"seek":49800,"start":498.0,"end":503.0,"text":" The dollar cost of a merge PR fell 26% over the last year.","tokens":[50364,440,7241,2063,295,257,22183,11568,5696,7551,4,670,264,1036,1064,13,50614],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.18819956481456757,"compression_ratio":1.5338983535766602,"no_speech_prob":0.03513258695602417},{"id":104,"seek":49800,"start":503.0,"end":506.0,"text":" Not PRs created, but PRs merged.","tokens":[50614,1726,11568,82,2942,11,457,11568,82,36427,13,50764],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.18819956481456757,"compression_ratio":1.5338983535766602,"no_speech_prob":0.03513258695602417},{"id":105,"seek":49800,"start":506.0,"end":512.0,"text":" Review time is factored in, and some level of quality gates has been cleared.","tokens":[50764,19954,565,307,1186,2769,294,11,293,512,1496,295,3125,19792,575,668,19725,13,51064],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.18819956481456757,"compression_ratio":1.5338983535766602,"no_speech_prob":0.03513258695602417},{"id":106,"seek":49800,"start":512.0,"end":519.0,"text":" That decline in cost per merge PR includes a 60X increase in AI costs over the same timeframe.","tokens":[51064,663,15635,294,2063,680,22183,11568,5974,257,4060,55,3488,294,7318,5497,670,264,912,34830,13,51414],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.18819956481456757,"compression_ratio":1.5338983535766602,"no_speech_prob":0.03513258695602417},{"id":107,"seek":49800,"start":519.0,"end":521.0,"text":" The change is nearly universal too.","tokens":[51414,440,1319,307,6217,11455,886,13,51514],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.18819956481456757,"compression_ratio":1.5338983535766602,"no_speech_prob":0.03513258695602417},{"id":108,"seek":49800,"start":521.0,"end":526.0,"text":" 83% of the companies we studied showed a drop in cost per PR.","tokens":[51514,30997,4,295,264,3431,321,9454,4712,257,3270,294,2063,680,11568,13,51764],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.18819956481456757,"compression_ratio":1.5338983535766602,"no_speech_prob":0.03513258695602417},{"id":109,"seek":52600,"start":526.0,"end":528.0,"text":" What does this tell us?","tokens":[50364,708,775,341,980,505,30,50464],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.1951291561126709,"compression_ratio":1.5024631023406982,"no_speech_prob":0.011685975827276707},{"id":110,"seek":52600,"start":528.0,"end":535.0,"text":" The additional throughput gains are spreading salary thinner across PRs,","tokens":[50464,440,4497,44629,16823,366,15232,15360,21905,2108,11568,82,11,50814],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.1951291561126709,"compression_ratio":1.5024631023406982,"no_speech_prob":0.011685975827276707},{"id":111,"seek":52600,"start":535.0,"end":539.0,"text":" and this is happening faster than the AI costs are increasing.","tokens":[50814,293,341,307,2737,4663,813,264,7318,5497,366,5662,13,51014],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.1951291561126709,"compression_ratio":1.5024631023406982,"no_speech_prob":0.011685975827276707},{"id":112,"seek":52600,"start":542.0,"end":544.0,"text":" What's the range in tokens spent?","tokens":[51164,708,311,264,3613,294,22667,4418,30,51264],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.1951291561126709,"compression_ratio":1.5024631023406982,"no_speech_prob":0.011685975827276707},{"id":113,"seek":52600,"start":544.0,"end":551.0,"text":" We ranked companies by token usage, then grouped them into quintiles, or fifths.","tokens":[51264,492,20197,3431,538,14862,14924,11,550,41877,552,666,40006,4680,11,420,9266,82,13,51614],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.1951291561126709,"compression_ratio":1.5024631023406982,"no_speech_prob":0.011685975827276707},{"id":114,"seek":52600,"start":551.0,"end":553.0,"text":" The range here is quite large.","tokens":[51614,440,3613,510,307,1596,2416,13,51714],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.1951291561126709,"compression_ratio":1.5024631023406982,"no_speech_prob":0.011685975827276707},{"id":115,"seek":55300,"start":553.0,"end":562.0,"text":" The lightest group, about 0.3% of the cost of a PR, is AI.","tokens":[50364,440,1442,377,1594,11,466,1958,13,18,4,295,264,2063,295,257,11568,11,307,7318,13,50814],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.15829093754291534,"compression_ratio":1.4285714626312256,"no_speech_prob":0.022625258192420006},{"id":116,"seek":55300,"start":562.0,"end":567.0,"text":" This represents about 60 million tokens per dev per month.","tokens":[50814,639,8855,466,4060,2459,22667,680,1905,680,1618,13,51064],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.15829093754291534,"compression_ratio":1.4285714626312256,"no_speech_prob":0.022625258192420006},{"id":117,"seek":55300,"start":567.0,"end":574.0,"text":" The top 20% of AI spend per dev, we're going to call the heaviest spend group.","tokens":[51064,440,1192,945,4,295,7318,3496,680,1905,11,321,434,516,281,818,264,3577,6495,3496,1594,13,51414],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.15829093754291534,"compression_ratio":1.4285714626312256,"no_speech_prob":0.022625258192420006},{"id":118,"seek":55300,"start":574.0,"end":578.0,"text":" There, 8.5% of the PR cost is AI.","tokens":[51414,821,11,1649,13,20,4,295,264,11568,2063,307,7318,13,51614],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.15829093754291534,"compression_ratio":1.4285714626312256,"no_speech_prob":0.022625258192420006},{"id":119,"seek":57800,"start":578.0,"end":583.0,"text":" This represents about 2.5 billion tokens per dev per month,","tokens":[50364,639,8855,466,568,13,20,5218,22667,680,1905,680,1618,11,50614],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.215194433927536,"compression_ratio":1.4461538791656494,"no_speech_prob":0.010324687696993351},{"id":120,"seek":57800,"start":583.0,"end":587.0,"text":" about two orders of magnitude more than the lightest group.","tokens":[50614,466,732,9470,295,15668,544,813,264,1442,377,1594,13,50814],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.215194433927536,"compression_ratio":1.4461538791656494,"no_speech_prob":0.010324687696993351},{"id":121,"seek":57800,"start":587.0,"end":594.0,"text":" We'll use these groups on the next slides to see how token spend influences other metrics.","tokens":[50814,492,603,764,613,3935,322,264,958,9788,281,536,577,14862,3496,21222,661,16367,13,51164],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.215194433927536,"compression_ratio":1.4461538791656494,"no_speech_prob":0.010324687696993351},{"id":122,"seek":57800,"start":594.0,"end":599.0,"text":" First, PR throughput measured as merged PRs per dev.","tokens":[51164,2386,11,11568,44629,12690,382,36427,11568,82,680,1905,13,51414],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.215194433927536,"compression_ratio":1.4461538791656494,"no_speech_prob":0.010324687696993351},{"id":123,"seek":57800,"start":599.0,"end":601.0,"text":" Split by the same.","tokens":[51414,45111,538,264,912,13,51514],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.215194433927536,"compression_ratio":1.4461538791656494,"no_speech_prob":0.010324687696993351}],"usage":{"type":"duration","seconds":602}}